text.paragraph:
Initiate ticagrelor tablets with a daily maintenance dose of aspirin of 75 mg to 100 mg. However, in patients who have undergone percutaneous coronary intervention (PCI), consider single antiplatelet therapy with ticagrelor tablets based on the evolving risk for thrombotic versus bleeding events [see Warnings and Precautions (5.1) and 
                           Clinical Studies (14)
                           ].

60 mg and 90 mg tablets. (
                              3
                           )

Immune system disorders: Hypersensitivity reactions including angioedema [see Contraindications
 (4.3)
].

Ticagrelor increases serum concentration of rosuvastatin because rosuvastatin is a BCRP substrate [see Clinical Pharmacology 
                           (12.3)
                           ].
